[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2486575741","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99407#issuecomment-2486575741","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99407","id":2486575741,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UNiJ9","user":{"login":"devloglogan","id":95497005,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbErLQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95497005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan","html_url":"https://github.com/devloglogan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-19T19:28:56Z","updated_at":"2024-11-19T19:28:56Z","body":"@Mickeon / @AThousandShips thanks so much for the review! I believe I've applied all your suggested changes. :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2486575741/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2506690540","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99407#issuecomment-2506690540","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99407","id":2506690540,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VaQ_s","user":{"login":"devloglogan","id":95497005,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbErLQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95497005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan","html_url":"https://github.com/devloglogan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-28T19:40:03Z","updated_at":"2024-11-28T19:40:03Z","body":"Thanks for the review @BastiaanOlij!\r\n\r\n1. `render_target_size_multiplier` is taken into account on the creation of the swapchain, and the resolution recommendation from the OpenXR extension will always be less than or equal to the inital size of the swapchain. I've tested modifying this multiplier and it seems to work fine with the OpenXR extension. Do you have concerns about setting `render_region` outside of the use of this extension? Perhaps we could add a check so that the region would have to be in the bounds of the swapchain size? [From the spec](https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.1/html/xrspec.html#XR_META_recommended_layer_resolution):\r\n\r\n\r\n>If the `XrRecommendedLayerResolutionGetInfoMETA::layer` attribute of the info argument of the function contains valid swapchain handles in all fields where required, the runtime must return a resolution recommendation which is less than or equal to the size of that swapchain, so that the application may render into an existing swapchain or swapchains without reallocation.\r\n\r\n\r\n2. Understood, I believe in my most recent changes `render_region` should now be thread safe. :)\r\n\r\n3. The OpenXR `XrRecommendedLayerResolutionGetInfoMETA` struct needs the projection layer to be set as the `layer` property in order for the extension to return a resolution of lesser or equal value via the `xrGetRecommendedLayerResolutionMETA()` function. I believe the only alternative would be introducing vendor specific structs or functions to this PR, which I know we don't want. So exposing the projection layer is probably the only way we'll be able to make this OpenXR extension work.\r\n\r\n4. Don't have a good response to this right now, but I'll look into it and get back to you!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2506690540/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2523804954","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99407#issuecomment-2523804954","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99407","id":2523804954,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WbjUa","user":{"login":"devloglogan","id":95497005,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbErLQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95497005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan","html_url":"https://github.com/devloglogan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-06T17:28:08Z","updated_at":"2024-12-06T17:28:08Z","body":"@BastiaanOlij  the VRS map did indeed need to be calculated based on `render_region`. I've made it do so in my latest push, tested both on standalone and PCVR. I'm not aware of any other built-in effects that are affected by this change, but if you have any more concerns let me know and I can test them out!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2523804954/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2555365248","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99407#issuecomment-2555365248","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99407","id":2555365248,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YT8eA","user":{"login":"devloglogan","id":95497005,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbErLQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95497005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan","html_url":"https://github.com/devloglogan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-19T17:45:22Z","updated_at":"2024-12-19T17:45:22Z","body":"@clayjohn thanks for sharing the suggested changes! I've applied them in my latest push. :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2555365248/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2579226274","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99407#issuecomment-2579226274","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99407","id":2579226274,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Zu96i","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-09T05:45:00Z","updated_at":"2025-01-09T05:45:00Z","body":"Looks good to me. \r\n\r\nMy only cringe is still the get_projection_layer being exposed, but looking at how it is used for `xrGetRecommendedLayerResolutionMETA`, it seems its only needed for info, not to actually change or update the data (which is my main concern because that can cause breaking logic being introduced).\r\n\r\nMaybe we should define the function as `const XrCompositionLayerProjection *OpenXRAPI::get_projection_layer() const`.\r\nGetters should always be const if possible, but also returning a const pointer would communicate clearly that the contents should not be altered. \r\n`XrRecommendedLayerResolutionGetInfoMETA` takes a const pointer to begin with so it shouldn't pose a problem.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2579226274/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2580617329","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99407#issuecomment-2580617329","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99407","id":2580617329,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z0Rhx","user":{"login":"devloglogan","id":95497005,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbErLQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/95497005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan","html_url":"https://github.com/devloglogan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/devloglogan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-09T15:48:24Z","updated_at":"2025-01-09T15:48:24Z","body":"> Maybe we should define the function as `const XrCompositionLayerProjection *OpenXRAPI::get_projection_layer() const`. Getters should always be const if possible, but also returning a const pointer would communicate clearly that the contents should not be altered. `XrRecommendedLayerResolutionGetInfoMETA` takes a const pointer to begin with so it shouldn't pose a problem.\r\n\r\nMakes sense to me! I've updated the function signature.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2580617329/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2584465555","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99407#issuecomment-2584465555","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99407","id":2584465555,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aC9CT","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/